  #   fpr  6F71 F525 2828 41EE DAF8  51B4 2F59 B5F9 9B1B E0B4
  # Verified 2026-10-14: identical from deb.nodesource.com and keyserver.ubuntu.com,
  # and it validates node_24.x/dists/nodistro/InRelease. Rotating it is an edit
  # here, made the same way.
